    "detailed_description": "A classic style adventure game about life and finding your pants. The more our hero tries to find them, the more things seem to spin out of control. The tone is funny but also kind of introspective, following the kind of crappy morning that makes you rethink every decision you\u2019ve ever made while wandering around in your underwear.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810610/extras/1a4ce52232882f6cf4e72cffec1925e9.poster.avif?t=1695805020\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810610/extras/1a4ce52232882f6cf4e72cffec1925e9.webp?t=1695805020\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div><br>This is a very short game!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810610/extras/bd3956c3b12533f395e142c3b40b9590.poster.avif?t=1695805020\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810610/extras/bd3956c3b12533f395e142c3b40b9590.webm?t=1695805020\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810610/extras/bd3956c3b12533f395e142c3b40b9590.mp4?t=1695805020\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810610/extras/52f540dff71f80a0e9f007eb6429ee60.avif?t=1695805020\" /></div><br>Solve retro style point-and-click puzzles on your quest to get out of the house.<br>Intricate, detailed pixel art brings a rainy workday morning to life. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810610/extras/0a641d88f2819508cd2081ad5e8749df.p